<p>Merge with one of your stone vines, traversing it to emerge near an entangled creature (maximum range 20).</p><p>Merging with the stone is beneficial for you, healing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">290, 345, 387, 421, 451</acronym> life (increases with Willpower).</p><p>This will not break Body of Stone.</p>